From: Drafter 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winegstreamer: Implement the remaining IMediaObject, property and attribute stubs of the WMV decoder.

The WMV video decoder's IMediaObject answers stream info, current types, size info,
latency, streaming resources and Lock, runs ProcessInput/ProcessOutput/Flush through the shared
dmo_transform.c helpers (S_FALSE without output), validates the compressed bitmap header, and keeps
IPropertyBag/IPropertyStore values in memory. The semi-stub FIXMEs on the attribute objects and the
documented E_NOTIMPL answers lose their FIXME. todo_wine marks that now pass are removed.
